            <ArticleTitle>Uncommon presentations in neuroblastoma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>573-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two cases of neuroblastoma with unusual presentation are reported. In the first case it presented as a general swelling of the head and in the second case it presented as generalized pains in the bones particularly the pelvis and left leg.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
